  "description": "Find the minimum window substring in s that contains all characters in t.",
  "target": "BANC",
  "pseudocode": "1. map = freq of t\n2. l=0, r=0, count=t.len\n3. while r < s.len:\n4.   if map[s[r]] > 0: count--\n5.   map[s[r]]--\n6.   r++\n7.   while count == 0:\n8.     update minWindow\n9.     if map[s[l]] == 0: count++\n10.    map[s[l]]++\n11.    l++",
